    "text": "This is a heuristic first-fit packing solution. I have not compiled or run it, and its score estimate is approximate.\n\n**Approach**\n1. **Residential choice:** residential projects are ranked by capacity per occupied cell, and the best one that still fits is placed first.\n2. **Utility choice:** for each utility type, only the project with the fewest occupied cells is kept. Types are sorted by that size.\n3. **Layout:** the city is filled in row-major order, one building at a time. Each building goes in the first position where none of its occupied cells overlap an already occupied cell. The sequence is `m` residential buildings, then one utility, cycling through the `k` smallest utility types.\n4. **Config selection:** the program builds layouts for `k` in {1, 2, 3, 5, 8} and `m` in {1, 3}. It scores each layout with an approximate score and outputs the best.\n5. **Approximate score:** for scoring, the distance between two buildings is the gap between their bounding boxes. Plans touch all four edges of their bounding box, so this is exact for rectangles and a lower bound otherwise, so it may overestimate. It is used only to pick between configs; the real score depends on the true distances.\n6. **Time bound and determinism:** each layout stops after a fixed number of position tests (5\u00b710\u2077) rather than a clock check, so the output is deterministic. A project that fails to fit once is never retried, since the grid only gets fuller.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nstruct B{char t;int h,w,v;vector<pair<int,int>> cells;};\nint H,W,D,NB;\nvector<B> bs;\nstruct Pl{int b,r,c;};\nvector<Pl> gen(int k,int m,const vector<int>&res,const vector<int>&ut){\n    vector<char> grid((size_t)H*W,0);\n    vector<int> rowPtr(H,0);\n    int startRow=0;\n    long long ops=0,budget=50000000LL;\n    vector<char> failed(NB,0);\n    vector<Pl> out;\n    bool stop=false;\n    auto place=[&](int p)->bool{\n        const B&b=bs[p];\n        for(int r=startRow;r<=H-b.h;r++){\n            for(int c=rowPtr[r];c<=W-b.w;c++){\n                if(++ops>budget){stop=true;return false;}\n                bool ok=true;\n                for(auto&q:b.cells){\n                    if(grid[(size_t)(r+q.first)*W+c+q.second]){ok=false;break;}\n                }\n                if(ok){\n                    for(auto&q:b.cells)grid[(size_t)(r+q.first)*W+c+q.second]=1;\n                    for(int i=r;i<r+b.h;i++){\n                        while(rowPtr[i]<W&&grid[(size_t)i*W+rowPtr[i]])rowPtr[i]++;\n                    }\n                    while(startRow<H&&rowPtr[startRow]>=W)startRow++;\n                    out.push_back({p,r,c});\n                    return true;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    };\n    int ri=0,cyc=0;\n    int kk=min<int>(k,ut.size());\n    bool utAlive=true;\n    while(!stop){\n        for(int i=0;i<m&&!stop;i++){\n            bool placed=false;\n            while(ri<(int)res.size()){\n                if(place(res[ri])){placed=true;break;}\n                if(stop)break;\n                ri++;\n            }\n            if(!placed){stop=true;}\n        }\n        if(stop)break;\n        if(utAlive){\n            bool any=false;\n            for(int a=0;a<kk;a++){\n                int t=(cyc++)%kk;\n                if(failed[ut[t]])continue;\n                if(place(ut[t])){any=true;break;}\n                if(stop)break;\n                failed[ut[t]]=1;\n            }\n            if(!any&&!stop){\n                bool all=true;\n                for(int a=0;a<kk;a++)if(!failed[ut[a]])all=false;\n                if(all)utAlive=false;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return out;\n}\nlong long evalL(const vector<Pl>&pl){\n    int BK=64;\n    int bh=(H+BK-1)/BK+1,bw=(W+BK-1)/BK+1;\n    vector<vector<int>> bucket((size_t)bh*bw);\n    for(int i=0;i<(int)pl.size();i++){\n        if(bs[pl[i].b].t=='U')bucket[(size_t)(pl[i].r/BK)*bw+pl[i].c/BK].push_back(i);\n    }\n    vector<int> stamp(1001,-1);\n    long long total=0;\n    int reach=(D+50)/BK+1;\n    for(int i=0;i<(int)pl.size();i++){\n        const B&a=bs[pl[i].b];\n        if(a.t!='R')continue;\n        int r1=pl[i].r,c1=pl[i].c,r2=r1+a.h-1,c2=c1+a.w-1;\n        int br=r1/BK,bc=c1/BK;\n        int cnt=0;\n        for(int x=max(0,br-reach);x<=min(bh-1,br+reach);x++)\n            for(int y=max(0,bc-reach);y<=min(bw-1,bc+reach);y++){\n                for(int j:bucket[(size_t)x*bw+y]){\n                    const B&u=bs[pl[j].b];\n                    int ur1=pl[j].r,uc1=pl[j].c,ur2=ur1+u.h-1,uc2=uc1+u.w-1;\n                    int dr=max(0,max(ur1-r2,r1-ur2)),dc=max(0,max(uc1-c2,c1-uc2));\n                    if(dr+dc<=D&&stamp[u.v]!=i){stamp[u.v]=i;cnt++;}\n                }\n            }\n        total+=(long long)cnt*a.v;\n    }\n    return total;\n}\nint main(){\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d %d\",&H,&W,&D,&NB);\n    bs.resize(NB);\n    for(int i=0;i<NB;i++){\n        char t[4];\n        scanf(\"%s %d %d %d\",t,&bs[i].h,&bs[i].w,&bs[i].v);\n        bs[i].t=t[0];\n        for(int r=0;r<bs[i].h;r++){\n            char s[64];\n            scanf(\"%s\",s);\n            for(int c=0;c<bs[i].w;c++)if(s[c]=='#')bs[i].cells.push_back({r,c});\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int> res;\n    map<int,int> bestU;\n    for(int i=0;i<NB;i++){\n        if(bs[i].t=='R')res.push_back(i);\n        else{\n            auto it=bestU.find(bs[i].v);\n            if(it==bestU.end()||bs[i].cells.size()<bs[it->second].cells.size())bestU[bs[i].v]=i;\n        }\n    }\n    sort(res.begin(),res.end(),[&](int a,int b){\n        long long x=(long long)bs[a].v*bs[b].cells.size(),y=(long long)bs[b].v*bs[a].cells.size();\n        if(x!=y)return x>y;\n        return a<b;\n    });\n    vector<int> ut;\n    for(auto&p:bestU)ut.push_back(p.second);\n    sort(ut.begin(),ut.end(),[&](int a,int b){\n        if(bs[a].cells.size()!=bs[b].cells.size())return bs[a].cells.size()<bs[b].cells.size();\n        return a<b;\n    });\n    int ks[]={1,2,3,5,8},ms[]={1,3};\n    vector<Pl> best;\n    long long bestS=-1;\n    for(int k:ks)for(int m:ms){\n        auto pl=gen(k,m,res,ut);\n        long long s=evalL(pl);\n        if(s>bestS){bestS=s;best=pl;}\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",(int)best.size());\n    for(auto&p:best)printf(\"%d %d %d\\n\",p.b,p.r,p.c);\n}\n```",
